COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."contact_requests" IS 'Phase 3: tenant requests to receive owner contact details. Attempts linked by (tenant_id, property_id, attempt_number). Max 3 attempts per property; only owner-decline burns an attempt. Snapshot frozen at INSERT — never mutated after creation.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."contact_requests"."owner_id" IS 'Denormalised from properties.owner_id at INSERT time. Avoids JOIN on every RLS check.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."contact_requests"."attempt_number" IS 'Auto-set by trg_contact_request_limits BEFORE INSERT. Only owner-decline (status=declined) increments the counter for the next attempt. withdrawn and auto_cancelled do NOT consume an attempt.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."contact_requests"."tenant_profile_snapshot" IS 'Frozen copy of tenant display_name, full_name, profile_photo_url, bio, member_since, and all rental_preferences fields at the moment of request submission. Render defensively — keys may be absent if rental_preferences schema evolves.';



